    <article>
        <articleInfo lang="EN" FirstPage="104" LastPage="114">
            <pdf>26304-jdecp-khakimova.pdf</pdf>
            <abstract>The article studies the solvability of multiparameter multiplicative classes of 2nd order ordinary differential equations using the method of discrete invariants. Invariants of discrete transformations closed in these classes of equations and their generalizations are considered. Concomitants are found that reduce the studied classes of differential equations to integrable equations of the 1st order. For some concomitants we managed to find inverse transformations. Exact general solutions are obtained for the corresponding subclasses of equations.</abstract>
            <title>Discrete transformation groups and solvability of multiparameter classes of ordinary differential equations</title>
            <keywords>
                <word>ordinary equation of the 2nd order</word>
                <word>multiplicative classes of differential equations</word>
                <word>discrete group of transformations</word>
                <word>concomitant</word>
                <word>invariant of a discrete transformation</word>
                <word>exact solution of a differential equation</word>
            </keywords>
